# Real user bills: raw statements must never enter the repository.
# Synthetic fixtures live in tests/fixtures/synthetic/ and are tracked.
# (We deliberately do NOT ignore *.csv / *.xlsx globally so synthetic
#  fixtures can be tracked; the patterns below only catch the classic
#  legacy artifact names used by the old pipeline.)
原始/
提取/
*entries.json
*ledger.json
*退款回链.json
*分类表.csv
*分类词典.csv
*待分类清单.csv
一木记账*.xls
一木记账*.xlsx
*核对.xlsx
